# cahunEquip: firearm and archery rules for hunting in Ontario. Sources: FWCA ss. 1 (firearm,
# loaded), 16, 19; O. Reg. 665/98 ss. 67, 69, 70, 75 to 79, 78.2, 82, 83; Hunting Regulations
# Summary 2026 (general regulations firearm tables).
# Stems ask for a fact a trained candidate knows; every option is a lawful-sounding candidate.
